# ==============================================================================
# HelpConnect Root Environment Template
# ==============================================================================
# HelpConnect is divided into:
#  - backend/   (Node.js / Express / MongoDB / Socket.IO API server)
#  - frontend/  (React / Vite client application)
#
# Follow the environment configuration in:
#  - backend/.env.example   (Server credentials, database, JWT, Redis, APIs)
#  - frontend/.env.example  (Public VITE_ client endpoints)
#
# Security Guidelines:
#  1. NEVER commit any `.env` files into Git.
#  2. NEVER put database credentials, JWT secrets, Cloudinary secrets,
#     or SMTP passwords in `frontend/.env`.
#  3. In production, configure environment variables directly in your cloud hosting
#     provider (Render, Railway, Fly.io, Vercel, AWS ECS, or Kubernetes Secrets).
# ==============================================================================
